{
  "info": {
    "name": "LedgerFlow API",
    "description": "Dokumentasi API LedgerFlow (Projekan S1)\n\n## Setup\n1. Import file ini ke Postman.\n2. Atur environment variable:\n   - `baseUrl` = `http://localhost:3000` (development) atau `https://<backend-vercel>.vercel.app` (production)\n3. Login terlebih dahulu lewat folder **Auth → Login**, token JWT otomatis tersimpan ke variable `token` (lihat tab Tests pada request Login).\n4. Semua request bertanda *Auth* memerlukan header `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}` — sudah diset otomatis di folder collection.\n\n## Auth\nSemua endpoint selain register/login/otp/forgot-password memakai Bearer token JWT yang berisi `sub`, `email`, `role`, `company_id`.\n\n## Role\n- `owner` — akses penuh\n- `admin` — kelola akun/user/periode, tanpa ubah jurnal\n- `akuntan` — input jurnal, tanpa kelola user/periode\n\n## Format Response List (paginasi)\nSemua endpoint list mengembalikan:\n```json\n{ \"data\": [...], \"total\": 0, \"page\": 1, \"limit\": 50 }\n```\nQuery parameter: `page`, `limit`, `search`, `sort`, dst. sesuai endpoint.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Nama User\",\n  \"email\": \"user@contoh.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\",\n  \"company_name\": \"PT Contoh Jaya\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.token) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('token', json.token);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('userId', json.user.id || '');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"owner@demo.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Demo123!\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Exchange Token (Google OAuth)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/exchange-token",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "exchange-token"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"supabase_token\": \"<token-dari-Supabase-OAuth>\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "WA Register Start",
          "description": "Mulai register via WhatsApp OTP: buat company + user, kode OTP 6 digit dikirim ke WA. Cooldown 60 detik.",
          "request": {
